    ["Trish from the hospital says don't come to the ER unless you're [dying|truly desperate]. She's on hour 16"] = "医院的特里什说除非你[快死了|真的走投无路]，别来急诊室。她已经干了16小时",
    ["speedway cancelled saturday. first time in 30 years. wendell [cried on the PA|said a prayer instead]"] = "赛车场取消了周六的比赛。30年来头一回。温德尔[在广播里哭了|做了祷告代替]",
    ["Gus says the cattle bawled all night. Fence held. Something [spooked|was walking around] them"] = "格斯说牛叫了一整夜。围栏没倒。有东西[吓到了|在它们周围走动]",
    ["gas line moves one car at a time. cash only. [3 hours|all afternoon] for ten gallons"] = "加油的队伍一次只走一辆车。只收现金。十加仑等了[3小时|一下午]",
    ["dads truck died at the railroad crossing. we [pushed it|coasted] to the shoulder. [bring the jug|come get us]"] = "爸的卡车在铁路道口熄火了。我们[把它推|滑行]到了路肩。[带上油壶|来接我们]",
    ["Tank's empty at the scales. I'm walking to the truck stop. Don't move the car"] = "磅秤那儿油箱空了。我走路去卡车休息站。别动车",
    ["Earl says channel 19 has gone quiet. First time in thirty years. [Just static|He sounded scared]"] = "厄尔说19频道安静了。三十年来头一回。[只有杂音|他听起来很害怕]",
    ["girl at the pump crying. [car dead|phone dead]. gave her [my charger|a ride]. she just kept saying her moms name"] = "加油泵旁有个女孩在哭。[车坏了|手机没电了]。我给了她[我的充电器|搭了一程]。她只是一直说着她妈妈的名字",
    ["Owner says chain the gate and go home. The safe stays. [I'll be back when this blows over|Keys under the mat]"] = "老板说把大门拴上回家。保险箱留着。[等这事过去我就回来|钥匙在门垫下面]",
    ["trooper told the campers they cant stay on the shoulder. theyre parked in the [church|school] lot now"] = "州警告诉露营的人不能待在路肩上。他们现在把车停在[教堂|学校]停车场",
    ["Gates are chained. Night shift stays inside. [Foreman has the keys|Don't try the fence]"] = "大门拴上了。夜班留在里面。[工头有钥匙|别碰围栏]",
    ["been inside the plant since [tuesday|3 days]. foreman says wait it out. out of [coffee|cigarettes]"] = "从[周二|3天前]起就一直在厂里。工头说等着熬过去。[咖啡|烟]没了",
    ["Doug came by. He's keeping a list of houses where nobody answers. [Ours isn't on it|Don't be on it]"] = "道格来过。他在记没人应门的人家名单。[我们不在上面|别上去]",
    ["climbed the water tower for signal. no smoke from the stacks. [first time ever|plants dark]"] = "爬上水塔找信号。烟囱没冒烟。[史上头一回|工厂都黑了]",
    ["Generator's down. [Rationing flashlights|Rotating watch]. Stay in pairs"] = "发电机停了。[手电筒限量使用|轮流值班]。要两人一组",
    ["somebody on c shift got sick. they put him in the office. door's locked. nobody goes in"] = "C班有个人病了。他们把他放在办公室里。门锁着。谁也不进去",
    ["Earl hasn't been on the CB since [this morning|yesterday]. Battery maybe. I'll go by"] = "厄尔[今早|昨天]起就没上CB电台了。也许是电池。我去看看",
    ["gun store lights are out. nobody at the back. hank's truck is still in the lot"] = "枪店的灯灭了。后面没人。汉克的卡车还在停车场",
    ["Feed store sign says Back Monday. Today's Thursday. [Don't count on it|I wouldn't wait]"] = "饲料店的牌子写着周一回来。今天是周四。[别指望了|我不会等]",
    ["gus didnt show at the Brott place this morning. the cattle bawled all night"] = "格斯今早没来布罗特农场。牛叫了一整夜",
    ["No announcements from the speedway in two days. Not even the birds out there"] = "赛车场两天没有广播了。连鸟都没有",
    ["The Brott gate is torn open. Cows on the road. Gus's hat [by the gate|in the ditch]"] = "布罗特家的大门被撕开了。牛在路上。格斯的帽子在[大门旁|沟里]",
    ["becky is sleeping in the stockroom. her moms still in louisville. [bring her stuff|check on her]"] = "贝基睡在库房里。她妈妈还在路易斯维尔。[给她送点东西|去看看她]",
    ["Mall is chained shut. Nobody in, nobody out. Don't come in"] = "商场被锁链锁死了。谁也不能进出。别来",
    ["rev lois wont leave the church. somebody has to keep the list she says. [bring her coffee|send food]"] = "洛伊丝牧师不肯离开教堂。她说得有人保管名单。[给她送咖啡|送点吃的]",
    ["Mrs. Henderson's door is [open now|still shut]. [Nobody home|There's a note]. I don't want to go in"] = "亨德森太太的门[现在开着|还关着]。[没人在家|有张字条]。我不想进去",
    ["bunker gate has a new padlock. army lock. [nobody goes up|who has the key]"] = "地堡大门换了新挂锁。军用锁。[没人上去|谁有钥匙]",
    ["Lois read the list at noon. [Eleven|Thirteen] names now. We know most of them"] = "洛伊丝中午念了名单。现在有[十一|十三]个名字。大多数我们都认识",
    ["Neighbors are doing door checks every morning at 8. Sign the sheet at the church [so they know|or they'll mark you]"] = "邻居们每天早上8点挨家查看。到教堂在登记表上签名，[好让他们知道|不然他们会给你做标记]",
    ["some names on the church list have a red mark now. lois wont say what it means"] = "教堂名单上有些名字现在带红色记号。洛伊丝不肯说是什么意思",
    ["I took soup to [the Jenkins place|old Mr. Peterson]. Door locked. No answer. I left it on the step"] = "我给[詹金斯家|老彼得森先生]送了汤。门锁着。没人应。我放在台阶上了",
    ["Two more towers dark. Ray's still not back. Dot's alone on the switchboard"] = "又有两座信号塔黑了。雷还没回来。多特一个人守着总机",
    ["The house phone is gone. Dot at Knox Mobile said keep the cell close. She called me hon. [I cried|It helped]"] = "家里电话没了。Knox Mobile的多特说手机要放在身边。她叫我亲爱的。[我哭了|有帮助]",
    ["Tried calling [three|four] times. All circuits busy. Your mother got my text. Finally"] = "试着打了[三|四]次。线路全忙。你妈妈收到我的短信了。总算",
    ["Went up in the attic for a bar. My message sat in the queue till [2am|4am]. Then it went"] = "爬到阁楼找信号。我的消息在队列里卡到[凌晨2点|凌晨4点]。然后才发出去",
    ["lady at the IGA begging to use somebodys phone. her house phone's dead. i let her use mine"] = "IGA有位女士求别人借她手机。她家电话断了。我把我的借给她了",
    ["back room at twiggys gets two bars. people sleeping by the outlet waiting to charge"] = "Twiggy's后屋有两格信号。有人睡在插座旁等着充电",
    ["Dot texted me herself. Ray hasn't come back. She's staying at the switchboard alone. Pray for her"] = "多特亲自给我发了短信。雷还没回来。她一个人守着总机。为她祈祷",
    ["coach texted everybody. practice cancelled. check on each other he said. [weird|thats not like him]"] = "教练给大家发短信。训练取消。他说互相照应。[怪了|不像他]",
    ["kayla made it to the motel. room 12. phone at 12%. [safe for now|dont tell mom]"] = "凯拉到汽车旅馆了。12号房。手机只剩12%电。[暂时安全|别告诉妈妈]",
    ["bobbys board is still by the lumberyard fence. nobody's seen him. or travis"] = "鲍比的滑板还在木材场围栏旁。没人见过他。特拉维斯也没有",
    ["heard [screams|shots] by the school at [2|3]am. dad said stay down. quiet now"] = "听到学校那边有[尖叫声|枪声]，是凌晨[2|3]点。爸说趴下。现在安静了",
    ["31W is still blocked. The [daycare|camp] is on the other side. They say wait it out"] = "31W还封着。[日托|营地]在另一边。他们说等着熬过去",
    ["Camp isn't answering. The bus didn't come back. [Somebody went to check|I'm driving out there]"] = "营地不接电话。大巴没回来。[有人去查看了|我开车过去]",
    ["Saw [them|those people] by the swing set. I pushed the dresser in front of the door. Kids are upstairs with me"] = "看到[他们|那些人]在秋千旁。我把五斗柜推到门口顶住。孩子们和我在楼上",
    ["Two cans of formula left. Church truck [Tuesday|maybe]. I'm stretching it with water"] = "只剩两罐配方奶了。教会的卡车[周二|也许]来。我兑水撑着用",
    ["We're closed. Your last check is [$312|$287]. It's [under the mat|in the drop box]. I'm sorry"] = "我们关门了。你的最后一张支票是[312美元|287美元]。放在[门垫下面|投递箱里]。对不起",
    ["Store's locked for good. Final check is in the office drop box. [Bring ID|Take care of yourself]"] = "店永久关门了。最后一张支票在办公室投递箱里。[带上证件|保重]",
    ["Gates locked this morning. Payroll is in the trailer [Friday|Monday]. Sign the book"] = "大门今早锁了。工资单在拖车里，[周五|周一]。在簿子上签字",
    ["Skeleton crew only. Don't come in. Checks are held at the courthouse until the roads open"] = "只留最少人手。别来。支票在法院扣着，等路通了再说",
    ["The truck got turned back at the fence. Shelves are empty. There's no work. Go home to your people"] = "卡车在围栏那儿被劝返。货架是空的。没活干。回家陪家人吧",
    ["upstairs for signal. one bar if i hold it by the window. [u there|answer me]"] = "上楼找信号。把手机举在窗边有一格。[你在吗|回我]",
    ["Gus says the horses screamed all night down by the river. He's never heard that"] = "格斯说马整夜在河边尖叫。他从没听过那样的声音",
    ["bobby went looking for travis last night. no word. his phones off"] = "鲍比昨晚去找特拉维斯了。没消息。他手机关机了",
    ["mom cant stop crying. dads at the plant. its just me and her here"] = "妈妈一直哭。爸爸在工厂。这里只有我和她",
    ["the wedding place called. cancelled. deposit's gone. [who cares now|doesnt matter]"] = "办婚礼的地方来电话了。取消了。订金没了。[现在谁在乎|无所谓了]",
    ["found dads CB in the garage. voices on channel 9 but i cant make them out. [still listening|its so far away]"] = "在车库里找到爸爸的CB电台。9频道里有声音，但听不清。[还在听|太远了]",
    ["both bridges blocked. concrete barriers and soldiers. [nobody crossing|they turned a guy around at gunpoint]"] = "两座桥都被封了。水泥路障和士兵。[没人能过|他们用枪逼着让一个人掉头]",
    ["kayla tried the interstate north. soldiers at every ramp. shes [walking back|staying with a friend]"] = "凯拉试了往北的州际公路。每个匝道都有士兵。她[走回来了|住在朋友那儿]",
    ["Water's almost gone on our street. I filled the tub. Boil anything you drink"] = "我们这条街的水快没了。我把浴缸放满了。喝的东西都要煮开",
    ["Tony's last text was 3 hours ago. At the hospital. Don't wait for me he said"] = "托尼最后一条短信是3小时前。在医院。他说别等我",
    ["Curfew at 9. Heard boots on the porch last night. Don't answer the door for anybody"] = "9点宵禁。昨晚听到门廊上有靴子声。谁来都别开门",
    ["Grandma's neighbor across the hall isn't answering. [Her door's open|I'm going over]"] = "奶奶对门的邻居不应门。[她的门开着|我过去看看]",
    ["The ferry's chained shut. We're stuck on this side. [Stay put|Come to the lake]"] = "渡口用链子锁死了。我们困在这一边。[待着别动|来湖边]",
    ["the old man down the road didnt answer his door. car's there. papers piling up"] = "路那头的老人没应门。车在那儿。报纸堆起来了",
    ["Grandma's neighbor left in a hurry last night. Door open, dog loose. I'm taking the dog"] = "奶奶的邻居昨晚匆忙离开了。门开着，狗跑出来了。我把狗带走了",
    ["all the lake houses are empty now. keys under the mats. its so quiet you can hear the water"] = "湖边的房子现在都空了。钥匙在门垫下。安静得能听见水声",
    ["Another site just dropped. Ray got turned back at the checkpoint. The Army won't let the truck through"] = "又一个站点掉线了。雷在检查站被劝返。军队不让卡车通过",
    ["The new girl didn't come in. Her mother called crying. Somebody at their door. I said I'd pray"] = "新来的姑娘没来上班。她妈妈哭着打来电话。有人在她们家门口。我说我会祈祷",
    ["Two sites on generator. Maybe three days of diesel. I'm sleeping in the break room. Don't worry about me, hon"] = "两个站点在用发电机。柴油大概够三天。我睡在休息室。别担心我，亲爱的",
    ["If you're reading this, the network's still up. Call your people while you can. Dot"] = "如果你看到这条，网络还在。趁还能打，给你的亲人打电话。多特",
    ["the janitors still in the school. lights on at night. [i see him at the window|hes all alone in there]"] = "清洁工还在学校里。晚上灯亮着。[我在窗口看到他了|他一个人在里面]",
    ["mr peterson's car hasnt moved from the school lot in [two|three] days. his window's down"] = "彼得森先生的车在学校停车场[两|三]天没动过了。他的车窗是摇下来的",
    ["The school freezers are thawing. You can smell it from the street. Nobody will open the kitchen"] = "学校的冰柜在化冻。在街上就能闻到。没人肯开厨房",
    ["The principal's wife came by. He never came home. I gave her the spare key"] = "校长的妻子来过。他一直没回家。我把备用钥匙给了她",
    ["Don't come in this week. The boss said lock it and walk away. Tips are in the safe. Who knows"] = "这周别来了。老板说锁好门走人。小费在保险箱里。谁知道呢",
    ["Danny's last text was 4 hours ago. Mom I'm cold. The number just rings now"] = "丹尼最后一条短信是4小时前。妈我好冷。号码现在只响铃",
    ["Saw a Humvee on 31W at the checkpoint. Door open. His cover on the seat. It might not be his"] = "在31W检查站看到一辆悍马。车门开着。他的军帽在座位上。也许不是他的",
    ["the base PA has been playing taps on a loop since midnight. you can hear it in west point"] = "基地广播从午夜起一直循环播放熄灯号。在西点镇都能听到",
    ["Two soldiers went to the Coyles' door. Mrs. Coyle didn't scream. She just nodded"] = "两个士兵去了科伊尔家门口。科伊尔太太没有尖叫。她只是点了点头",
    ["Marcus texted: if you read this, go to the cabin. Don't wait for me"] = "马库斯发了短信：如果你看到这条，去木屋。别等我",
    ["The dog growled at the bedroom door all night. I'm sleeping on the couch"] = "狗整夜对着卧室门低吼。我睡在沙发上",
    ["left the back door open for the cat. two days. food bowl still full"] = "为猫留着后门开着。两天了。食盆还是满的",
    ["Neighbor's horse is in our yard with the saddle still on. Nobody's come for it"] = "邻居的马在我们院子里，鞍子还在身上。没人来牵",
    ["The cat keeps scratching at the attic hatch. All night. I don't want to open it"] = "猫一直在抓阁楼的盖板。整夜。我不想打开",
    ["the prayer chain is down to [12|8] names. they stopped reading them out loud"] = "祷告链只剩[12|8]个名字了。他们不再大声念了",
    ["Pastor Glen didn't come to the door this morning. They say he's resting. Let him be"] = "格伦牧师今早没来开门。他们说他在休息。让他安静吧",
    ["the funeral is [tuesday|wednesday]. no pastor. graveside only. family only"] = "葬礼在[周二|周三]。没有牧师。只在墓边。只有家人",
    ["The deacon went home to the Lord last night. No service. We buried him ourselves"] = "执事昨晚回天家了。没有仪式。我们自己埋了他",
    ["The kitchen still smells like Wednesday supper. Cornbread in the fridge. I ate alone"] = "厨房里还有周三晚餐的味道。玉米面包在冰箱里。我一个人吃的",
    ["some preacher on channel 19 shouting about judgment at 3am. somebody keyed over him with Psalm 23. then nothing"] = "19频道有个传教士凌晨3点在喊审判。有人用诗篇23篇插进去盖过他。然后什么都没了",
    ["The ring's still in the drawer. I never gave it to you. The roads are gone now"] = "戒指还在抽屉里。我从没给过你。路现在都没了",
    ["Your father took the truck to look for {partner}. He hasn't called"] = "你爸开卡车去找{partner}了。他还没来电话",
    ["The dress is in the closet. Tags still on. [Tell your mom|I'll tell her]"] = "裙子在衣柜里。吊牌还在。[你去告诉你妈|我来告诉她]",
    ["Can't reach [Grandma|your aunt] on the house phone. Can you [drive by|check on her] if the roads are open"] = "家里电话联系不上[奶奶|你姑姑]。路通的话你能[开车过去看看|去看看她]吗",
    ["went to the kroger. [doors chained|lot full of cops]. [a deputy|some cop] said curfew at 8"] = "去了Kroger。[门被链子锁着|停车场全是警察]。[一个副警长|某个警察]说8点宵禁",
    ["gun store in irvington [sold out|closed up]. guy said [people at the door all day|dont come back]"] = "欧文顿的枪店[卖光了|关门了]。那人说[人们整天堵在门口|别再来了]",
    ["motel's full. [nobody's checking out|people sleeping in their cars] [in the lot|out back]"] = "汽车旅馆满了。[没人退房|人们睡在车里][在停车场|在后面]",
}
